sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 Usuario
    participant W as ⚡ Worker
    participant DB as 🐘 Neon
    participant PS as 🔄 Privy Swap API
    participant G as ⛽ GasService
    participant PM as 📦 Pimlico
    participant M as ⛓️ Monad

    Note over U,M: Usuario tiene USDT + USDC<br/>Quiere enviar $50 a @carlos

    U->>W: POST /wallet/send (amount=50)
    W->>DB: consultar wallet_positions
    DB-->>W: USDC=10, USDT=45

    W->>W: Balance Composer<br/>USDC insuficiente → swap 40 USDT → USDC

    W->>PS: POST /swap/quote<br/>USDT→USDC, 40
    PS-->>W: { amountOut: 39.98, priceImpact: 0.05%, validUntil }

    W->>U: 200 { preview: "Enviar $50 a @carlos" }
    U->>W: confirmar

    W->>PS: POST /swap/execute
    PS->>G: sendTransaction (approve + swap)
    G->>PM: bundler + paymaster
    PM->>M: tx (gas cubierto por usuario en USDC)
    M-->>PM: confirmada
    PM-->>PS: txHash
    PS-->>W: { txHash, amountOut: 39.98 }

    W->>DB: INSERT swap_executions
    W->>DB: UPDATE wallet_positions
    W->>DB: INSERT movements (swap invisible)
    W->>DB: INSERT movements (send)

    W-->>U: 200 { movement, newBalance: $5.00 }
    Note over U: Usuario ve: "Enviaste $50 a @carlos"<br/>Nunca supo que hubo un swap